# Go
/bin/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
/dist/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent worktrees. `git worktree add` under .claude/ leaves a full checkout per agent, and
# repo-wide gates that walk from the root scan them: TestB30_NoCallerOutsideTheCoreAdopts
# TheWholeDurableBlob fails on `core.Save` inside an agent's copy of mobile/app.go, which is
# not a caller in this repository at all. Eighteen of them accumulated during one session.
.claude/worktrees/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
# Play publishing credential -- never committed. Lives at secrets/play-service-account.json,
# shared with quiet-training (one service account deploys both apps; owner-authorized copy).
/secrets/

# build artifacts. Every cmd/ target compiles to the repo root under an unqualified
# `go build ./cmd/...`, and this tree has six recorded incidents of a stray artifact reaching
# a commit. /swarm-relay was left here by a runbook verification that built the binary to
# prove its config template actually boots -- the right thing to do, needing the right guard.
/swarm
/swarm-relay
/swarm-remote
/swarm-char
/swarm-fake-agent
/swarm-publish
/swarm-pushgw

# Android (S13)
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
# PB-TOOL-2: the AAR and its sources jar are build outputs of android/build-aar.sh.
android/app/libs/
*.aar
# Kotlin 2.x writes build-session state here. It is a build output, it is not under any
# directory already ignored above, and this repository has five recorded incidents of a
# `git add -A` committing an artifact -- one of them a derivation mutation that reached a demo
# binary (ADR-007 B132 F1, residuals 4.7). Ignoring it is cheaper than the sixth.
android/.kotlin/

# internal/remote/relay/releaseprobe_test.go builds a throwaway package here (os.MkdirTemp with
# this prefix, at the repo root so it is invisible to ./...). The test removes it, so it exists
# only while that test runs -- which is exactly the window this repository keeps losing: a
# `git add -A` fired during a concurrent test run commits it, and the sixth instance of that
# class is already recorded (agents-tracker-62c). Observed untracked in a live status read.
_releaseprobe-*/

# Firebase client config for dev.swarm.phone (project swarm-8404f). Present locally so Wave R3
# can apply the google-services plugin; stays out of the repo until R3 decides how config ships.
android/app/google-services.json

# PB-TOOL-3: release signing material is operator-supplied and never enters the repository.
# local.properties additionally carries the machine's SDK path.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.bks
local.properties

# local agent scratch -- plans and red-run evidence; snippets are embedded in docs/verification
.claude/tmp/
